#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/message-reminders.rst:2
msgid "Set a reminder"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/message-reminders.rst:7
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v7.10, using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop "
"app, you can set 1 timed reminder on a post made in a channel, direct "
"message, and group message. The ability to set up recurring reminders "
"isn't supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/message-reminders.rst:9
msgid ""
"Hover over the message you want to remember, select the **More** |more-"
"icon| option, then select **Remind**. Select a time period or enter a "
"custom date and time. You'll receive a direct message at the time you've "
"chosen, with the body of the message you wanted to be reminded about."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:16
msgid "Use the More icon to access additional message options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/message-reminders.rst:11
msgid ""
"Once you've been reminded about a message, you won't receive another "
"reminder unless you set one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/message-reminders.rst:15
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.3, you can also schedule reminder messages to be sent"
" in the future. See the :doc:`schedule messages </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/schedule-messages>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""

